WEBVTT

00:01:30.143 --> 00:01:33.538
I replied that surely,
this was a case of mistaken identity,

00:01:33.562 --> 00:01:36.702
because I'm as far as you can get
from being an athlete.

00:01:36.726 --> 00:01:39.758
Actually, I wasn't even sure
that I could go around the stadium

00:01:39.782 --> 00:01:40.984
without a walker.

00:01:41.008 --> 00:01:42.071
(Laughter)

00:01:42.095 --> 00:01:44.594
I was told that this was
no laughing matter.

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:46.779
This would be the first time

00:01:46.803 --> 00:01:49.936
that only women
would carry the Olympic flag.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.579
Five women, representing five continents,

00:01:52.603 --> 00:01:55.784
and three Olympic gold medal winners.

00:01:56.134 --> 00:01:58.370
My first question was, naturally:

00:01:58.394 --> 00:01:59.937
What was I going to wear?

00:01:59.961 --> 00:02:01.055
(Laughter)